<title>USA: Florida Housing Finance Agency $9 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Florida Housing Finance Agency $9 mln repriced.</headline>
<text>
<p>FLORIDA HOUSING FINANCE AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $9,000,000*</p>
<p>HOUSING REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES B</p>
<p>(GLEN OAKS APARTMENTS PROJECT)</p>
<p>WE HAVE RECEIVED THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>				SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>	DATED: 06/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 02/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 02/01 &amp; 08/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>08/01/2007		  865M    5.20  %</p>
<p>08/01/2017		2,125M    5.80  %</p>
<p>02/01/2030		6,010M    5.90  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 08/01/2007 at 102.00, DTP 08/01/2009</p>
<p>PLEASE REFER TO PAGES 14 THROUGH 20 OF THE PRELIMINARY</p>
<p>OFFICIAL STATEMENT FOR ADDITIONAL REDEMPTION FEATURES.</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, June 24, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on June 26, 1997.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
